1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Q: TOEIC Part 2 核心考點影音情境複習 (001–034 高頻秒殺法則 × 6 大職場對話情境 × 聽力陷阱破解)
A: 共 14 分 48 秒原音同步 — 先聽 Q 預判語境，再抓關鍵詞秒選 A！ (點擊任意對話氣泡即可跳轉播放、循環跟讀或開啟考場全盲聽測驗。)

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:13,500
Q: Why did Alex cancel the meeting? (為什麼 Alex 取消了會議？)
A: There was a scheduling conflict. (行程衝突了。（○ 正解）)

3
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:20,000
Q: Do they want to use air or ground shipping? (他們想用空運還是陸運？)
A: Express air, please. (請用空運快捷。)

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Q: Do you know where Sue's office is? (你知道 Sue 的辦公室在哪裡嗎？)
A: It's on the third floor. (在三樓。)

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Q: How do I contact Joan? (我要怎麼聯絡 Joan？)
A: She left her business card. (她留了名片。)

6
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:43,200
Q: Did you enjoy the management workshop last week? (你喜歡上週的管理工作坊嗎？)
A: Absolutely, it was very informative. (當然，內容非常有幫助。)

7
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:50,500
Q: Could you give me a lift to the ceremony? (你可以載我去參加典禮嗎？)
A: Of course, I'm leaving in 15 minutes. (當然，我 15 分鐘後就出發。)

8
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:57,500
Q: I don't see a manual anywhere. (我到處都找不到手冊。)
A: Maybe the store forgot to include it. (可能是店家忘記把它放進去了。)

9
00:00:57,500 --> 00:01:05,000
Q: Hasn't the weekly meeting been postponed? (週會不是延期了嗎？)
A: Yes, it will now be on Friday. (對，現在改到星期五了。)

10
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:16,000
Q: 004. Keywords: but / instead / though (004 核心轉折字彙朗讀)
A: 聽到 but / instead / though，約 90% 為正確答案！ (表示語氣轉折或提出替代方案，最符合多益偏好間接回答的習慣。)

11
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:22,800
Q: Isn't the weather wonderful today? (今天天氣不是很好嗎？)
A: But it's probably going to rain tonight. (但今天晚上可能會下雨。)

12
00:01:22,800 --> 00:01:30,200
Q: Can I make an announcement before the meeting starts? (我可以在會議開始前做個宣布嗎？)
A: Yes, but keep it short. (可以，不過請長話短說。)

13
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:37,800
Q: Let's discuss the new project this afternoon. (我們今天下午來討論新的專案吧。)
A: We can do it tomorrow morning instead. (要不然我們明天早上討論吧。)

14
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:46,500
Q: We need to schedule a team meeting to discuss the sales results. (我們必須安排一場團隊會議來討論銷售成果。)
A: Jessica's still on vacation, though. (不過，Jessica 還在休假中。)

15
00:01:46,500 --> 00:01:53,500
Q: Where's the copier? (影印機在哪裡？)
A: Our copy machine is broken. (我們的影印機壞了。)

16
00:01:53,500 --> 00:01:59,800
Q: When will the play end? (這齣戲什麼時候結束？)
A: Sorry, I don't work here. (不好意思，我不是這裡的工作人員。)

17
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:07,500
Q: What did you tell the customers about the shipping delay? (你怎麼跟顧客說明配送延遲的事？)
A: Weren't you going to phone them? (你不是打算打電話給他們嗎？)

18
00:02:07,500 --> 00:02:18,500
Q: 006. I'm not sure. / That hasn't been decided yet. (006 萬用不確定金句朗讀)
A: 不知道、不確定、還沒決定 — Part 2 萬用百搭正解！ (只要聽到這兩句標準型句型，幾乎都能直接選。)

19
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:23,800
Q: Who's the marketing manager? (誰是行銷經理？)
A: I'm not sure. (我不太確定。)

20
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:30,800
Q: Where will the retreat be next month? (下個月的員工聯誼活動在哪裡舉行？)
A: That hasn't been decided yet. (那件事還沒有決定。)

21
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:38,000
Q: Can you check the packing machine today? (你今天能檢查一下包裝機器嗎？)
A: Sure, I'll put it on my list. (當然，我會把它加進我的待辦清單。)

22
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:47,500
Q: 007. Let me check it for you. / check (007 關鍵詞 check 朗讀)
A: 只要聽到 check 或 look at agenda/schedule，極高機率是正解！ (表示「去查看確認一下」的禮貌職場合理回應。)

23
00:02:47,500 --> 00:02:53,000
Q: Where did Charles leave the memo? (Charles 把備忘錄放在哪裡了？)
A: Check Darren's desk. (去 Darren 的桌子看看吧。)

24
00:02:53,000 --> 00:03:00,800
Q: I'd like to discuss the marketing plans sometime next week. (我想在下週找個時間討論行銷計畫。)
A: Let me check my schedule. (我來查看一下我的行程安排。)

25
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:08,200
Q: Why isn't John's presentation finished yet? (為什麼 John 的發表會還沒結束呢？)
A: He sent us a draft to check. (他寄了一份草稿給我們確認。)

26
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:14,800
Q: Who is going to give a speech at the ceremony? (誰會在典禮上發表演說？)
A: I'll look at the agenda. (我來查看一下議程。)

27
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:22,000
Q: Who's going to the CEO's talk tonight? (今晚誰會去聽執行長的談話？)
A: I'll have to look at my schedule. (我得查看一下我的行程。)

28
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:38,000
Q: 008. That's a good idea. / That's a great idea. (008 讚許提議核心句朗讀)
A: 提議型問句遇到 good / great idea，正解率約 80%！ (特別留意 good 與 great 的發音區別與連讀。)

29
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:45,000
Q: What if we moved these books to make more space? (我們把這些書移開來騰出更多空間如何？)
A: That's a great idea. (好主意。)

30
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:52,000
Q: Shouldn't we request approval from the director? (我們是不是應該請示主管批准？)
A: That's a good idea. (好主意。)

31
00:03:52,000 --> 00:04:00,500
Q: 009. Why → Because (009 因果直球公式朗讀)
A: Why 開頭問句搭配 Because 回答，約 90% 是正解！ (先鎖定疑問詞 Why，聽到 Because 先保留。)

32
00:04:00,500 --> 00:04:08,500
Q: Why is the restaurant closed early today? (為什麼這家餐廳今天提早打烊？)
A: Because it is reserved for a birthday party tonight. (因為今晚有人預約舉辦生日派對。)

33
00:04:08,500 --> 00:04:15,500
Q: Why was the party canceled? (為什麼派對取消了？)
A: Because few people wanted to attend. (因為想參加的人不多。)

34
00:04:15,500 --> 00:04:23,800
Q: Have you gone to the seminar yet? (你去參加那個研討會了嗎？)
A: Oh, I didn't know it was required. (喔，我不知道一定得去耶。)

35
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:30,200
Q: Didn't David buy a new car? (David 不是買了一輛新車嗎？)
A: No, not that I know of. (不，就我所知是沒有。)

36
00:04:30,200 --> 00:04:37,500
Q: Your tablet needs fixing, right? (你的平板需要修理，對吧？)
A: No, it's working perfectly. (不，它運作得很好。)

37
00:04:37,500 --> 00:04:42,000
Q: 011. Keyword: one (011 代名詞 one 朗讀)
A: 聽到 one（The one / One of / buying one），正解率高達 85%！ (用來避免重複問句中的名詞，符合多益防重複字原則。)

38
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:48,500
Q: What kind of bicycle do you have? (你有什麼樣的腳踏車？)
A: Are you thinking of buying one? (你打算買一台嗎？)

39
00:04:48,500 --> 00:04:55,000
Q: Who made a checklist for the business travel? (誰製作了出差的檢查清單？)
A: One of the managers. (其中一位經理。)

40
00:04:55,000 --> 00:05:01,500
Q: Which copier do you use? (你使用哪一台影印機？)
A: The one near Ms. Lee's desk. (李小姐桌子附近那台。)

41
00:05:01,500 --> 00:05:09,000
Q: Did you give the client the bill? (你把帳單交給客戶了嗎？)
A: Hasn't the payment arrived yet? (款項還沒收到嗎？)

42
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:15,200
Q: The report deadline is on Wednesday. (那份報告的截止日期是星期三。)
A: Where did you hear that? (你從哪裡聽來的？)

43
00:05:15,200 --> 00:05:22,000
Q: All the tickets for the concert are gone. (演唱會的票全都賣光了。)
A: Did you try online? (你有試著上網去看看嗎？)

44
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:30,000
Q: Wasn't Mr. Kim nominated for an award this year? (金先生今年不是被提名為某獎項候選人了嗎？)
A: Are you thinking of a business partner? (你是在思考要找個一起創業的夥伴嗎？)

45
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:39,200
Q: Wouldn't you rather travel somewhere during this weekend? (你這個週末不想去哪裡走走嗎？)
A: I'm planning to mow the lawn at my house. (我打算在家裡割草。)

46
00:05:39,200 --> 00:05:46,200
Q: Would you recommend a good place for dinner? (你可以推薦一間晚餐的餐廳嗎？)
A: I always bring food from home. (我總是從家裡帶便當來。)

47
00:05:46,200 --> 00:05:54,000
Q: Should we order lunch from the Korean restaurant? (我們要不要訂那間韓國餐廳的午餐？)
A: I brought something from home today. (我今天從家裡帶了點東西來吃。)

48
00:05:54,000 --> 00:06:02,000
Q: Whose turn is it to wash the dishes? (今天輪到誰洗碗？)
A: I already washed them yesterday. (我昨天已經洗過了。)

49
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:10,000
Q: How often will I need to renew my driver's license? (我多久得更新一次駕照？)
A: It's probably in this handbook. (這本手冊裡可能有寫。)

50
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:17,800
Q: Here are 10 copies of the sales report. (這裡有 10 份業務報告。)
A: Mary's joining us too. (Mary 也會過來加入我們喔。)

51
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:26,800
Q: Should I print copies of the report or e-mail them to all of the managers? (我應該把報告的紙本印出，還是 E-mail 給所有主管？)
A: Every one of them will have a laptop. (他們每個人都有筆電。)

52
00:06:26,800 --> 00:06:33,200
Q: What's the price of this book? (這本書多少錢？)
A: There may be a discount. (可能會有折扣。)

53
00:06:33,200 --> 00:06:40,500
Q: Do you think we should change office suppliers? (你覺得我們應該更換辦公用品供應商嗎？)
A: I haven't heard any complaints. (我沒聽說有任何抱怨。)

54
00:06:40,500 --> 00:06:47,000
Q: I think we should walk to the airport. (我覺得我們應該走路去機場。)
A: It is pretty far away. (那裡還蠻遠的。)

55
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:55,500
Q: Is this the only one of our designs that got approved? (這是我們設計中唯一獲得批准的那一個嗎？)
A: This client can be really demanding. (這位客戶可是真的很挑剔。)

56
00:06:55,500 --> 00:07:00,800
Q: 016. Keyword: budget (016 秒殺關鍵字 budget 朗讀)
A: 聽到 budget（預算），約 90% 為正確答案！ (TOEIC 最新出題趨勢超愛考預算限制。)

57
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:08,500
Q: Who's going with you to the seminar? (誰會跟你一起去參加那個研討會？)
A: We send only one person because of the budget cut. (我們因為預算削減，只派一個人去。)

58
00:07:08,500 --> 00:07:17,000
Q: How many new employees will we hire next month? (我們下個月要聘用幾位新進員工？)
A: The accounting manager has to finish the budget first. (會計主管得先完成預算。)

59
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:26,000
Q: Do you want to hire 5 or 10 more employees next quarter? (下一季你想多聘請 5 人還是 10 人？)
A: The budget is quite small now. (現在的預算很少。)

60
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:35,200
Q: Mr. Lee applied for the open sales position, didn't he? (李先生不是去應徵那個業務職缺嗎？)
A: No, it was already filled. (沒有，已經有人補上了。)

61
00:07:35,200 --> 00:07:41,500
Q: I'd like to see Ms. Park. (我想見一下朴小姐。)
A: She no longer works here. (她已經不在這裡工作了。)

62
00:07:41,500 --> 00:07:48,500
Q: We're still selling parasols, aren't we? (我們還在賣陽傘，對吧？)
A: Our supplier went out of business. (我們的供應商倒閉了。)

63
00:07:48,500 --> 00:07:55,500
Q: I don't know how to operate this forklift. (我不知道這台堆高機怎麼操作。)
A: I've never used it. (我從來沒用過。)

64
00:07:55,500 --> 00:08:03,000
Q: Do you take coffee or tea? (您要喝咖啡還是茶？)
A: Isn't there any juice? (沒有果汁嗎？)

65
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:11,000
Q: Who can I speak to about writing a weekly sales report? (我該找誰請教撰寫每週業務報告的事？)
A: Danaka will send you some guidelines. (Danaka 會傳一些指引給你。)

66
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:18,000
Q: How can I get some more paper clips? (我該怎麼拿到更多迴紋針？)
A: Tina takes care of that. (這件事是 Tina 負責的。)

67
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:25,200
Q: Can you please fix my photocopier? (你能幫我修一下影印機嗎？)
A: I'd be happy to. (我很樂意幫你。)

68
00:08:25,200 --> 00:08:32,800
Q: Did you review all the customer complaints? (你看完所有顧客的投訴了嗎？)
A: No, there are several more left. (還沒，還剩幾個。)

69
00:08:32,800 --> 00:08:40,000
Q: Would you like to take a tour of my language institute? (你想參觀一下我的語言學院嗎？)
A: Of course, I'd like to. (當然，我很樂意。)

70
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:47,500
Q: Can you look at my presentation slides today? (你今天能幫我看看我的簡報投影片嗎？)
A: Sure, I'd be glad to. (當然，我很樂意。)

71
00:08:47,500 --> 00:08:55,000
Q: 020. When → Not until (020 時間延遲句型朗讀)
A: 針對 When 問句，聽到 Not until / until 正解率約 80%！ (就算不是 When 問句，聽到 until 也要重點留意。)

72
00:08:55,000 --> 00:09:02,200
Q: When can you finish the project report? (你什麼時候能完成這份專案報告？)
A: Not until tomorrow at 5:00 p.m. (要到明天下午五點才行。)

73
00:09:02,200 --> 00:09:09,000
Q: Where will the vice president be staying? (副會長會住在哪裡？)
A: We won't know until April. (要到四月才會知道。)

74
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:16,000
Q: Could we have a meeting today? (我們今天能開會嗎？)
A: I'll be here until 6 o'clock. (我會待到六點。)

75
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:24,000
Q: 021. Keywords: only / just (021 限定詞 only / just 朗讀)
A: 選項中出現 only 或 just，正解率約 80%！ (常見於否定澄清或數量範圍限定。)

76
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:32,000
Q: Isn't John the most experienced engineer? (John 不是最有經驗的工程師嗎？)
A: No, he just graduated from high school. (不是，他才剛從高中畢業而已。)

77
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:39,200
Q: Is the room big enough for the conference? (這房間開會夠大嗎？)
A: Only seven women have enrolled. (只有 7 位女性報名。)

78
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:46,500
Q: Don't you have a seminar tomorrow? (你明天不是有場研討會嗎？)
A: That's just for the Human Resources Department. (那會議只有人資部門的人要參加。)

79
00:09:46,500 --> 00:09:53,500
Q: Who's cleaning this room? (誰在打掃這個房間？)
A: It's Tina's turn. (輪到 Tina 了。)

80
00:09:53,500 --> 00:09:58,500
Q: 023. Keyword: sure (023 肯定番號 sure 朗讀)
A: 聽到 sure，約 85% 是正解！注意 mind 問句陷阱。 (Do you mind...? 要回 Sure / OK / Not at all，絕不回 Yes。)

81
00:09:58,500 --> 00:10:05,500
Q: Should we ask the waitress to bring us some wine? (我們要請服務生拿些酒來嗎？)
A: Sure, when she comes back. (那當然，等她過來吧。)

82
00:10:05,500 --> 00:10:12,500
Q: Do you mind filling out the registration form? (您介意填一下登記表嗎？)
A: Sure. I can do that. (當然［不介意］。我可以填。)

83
00:10:12,500 --> 00:10:19,500
Q: Would you mind cleaning this room? (你介意打掃這房間嗎？)
A: OK, I'll take care of that. (好的，我來處理。)

84
00:10:19,500 --> 00:10:24,200
Q: 024. Keyword: sorry (024 婉拒關鍵字 sorry 朗讀)
A: 只要聽到 sorry 或 busy，正解機率高達 85%！ (常見結構：Sorry + 忙碌/工作理由。)

85
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:33,500
Q: Robin, Jane and I are going out for dinner after we finish this report. (我們完成這份報告後，打算和 Robin、Jane 一起去吃晚餐。)
A: Sorry, I have some other work to do. (抱歉，我還有其他工作要做。)

86
00:10:33,500 --> 00:10:41,000
Q: Do you want to look at the new delivery area? (你想看看新的配送區域嗎？)
A: Sorry, I'm very busy. (不好意思，我現在很忙。)

87
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:49,000
Q: 025. Keywords: problem / cancelled (025 突發狀況詞朗讀)
A: 聽到 problem / cancelled / postponed，極高機率為正解（90%）！ (直接點出故障或活動變動。)

88
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:56,500
Q: Why weren't the files uploaded to kinglish.com? (為什麼檔案沒有上傳到 kinglish.com？)
A: We had technical problems. (我們遇到了技術性的問題。)

89
00:10:56,500 --> 00:11:03,000
Q: When does the company dinner start? (公司晚宴什麼時候開始？)
A: It was cancelled. (已經取消了。)

90
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:19,500
Q: 026. Oh / Well / Hmm / Okay / Wow (026 五大口語感嘆詞朗讀)
A: 以 Oh / Well / Hmm / Okay / Wow 開頭，約 85% 是正解！ (聽出語氣的轉折或情緒反應。)

91
00:11:19,500 --> 00:11:26,500
Q: Where can I get lunch near this office? (這辦公室附近哪裡可以吃午餐呢？)
A: Well, you have several options. (嗯，你可以有幾個選擇。)

92
00:11:26,500 --> 00:11:34,500
Q: Wasn't this report due yesterday? (這份報告的交件期限不是昨天嗎？)
A: Oh, it's taking longer than we thought. (噢，其實比我們本來以為的更久。)

93
00:11:34,500 --> 00:11:43,800
Q: Sorry for interrupting, but I've reserved this room for a 3 o'clock appointment. (不好意思打擾了，我已經預約了這間會議室三點要用。)
A: Okay, we'll be leaving shortly. (好，我們馬上就離開。)

94
00:11:43,800 --> 00:11:52,000
Q: Here's the estimated bill for fixing your car. (這是您的汽車維修報價單。)
A: Wow, that's really expensive. (哇，真的很貴。)

95
00:11:52,000 --> 00:12:03,500
Q: 027. Keywords: actually / delay / still (027 澄清與狀態關鍵詞朗讀)
A: 聽到 actually / delay / still，正解率約 80%！ (常用於修正前提、說明延誤與進行中狀態。)

96
00:12:03,500 --> 00:12:10,500
Q: When will the lecture begin? (講座什麼時候開始？)
A: Actually, I'm not giving a lecture today. (實際上，我今天沒有安排講座。)

97
00:12:10,500 --> 00:12:16,800
Q: Shouldn't you have left for your business trip? (你不是該出發去出差了嗎？)
A: The train was delayed. (火車誤點了。)

98
00:12:16,800 --> 00:12:24,200
Q: Has the warranty expired for your car? (您的車輛已經保固期滿了嗎？)
A: No, I still have one more year. (不，還有一年。)

99
00:12:24,200 --> 00:12:31,500
Q: Where can I get this year's budget report? (今年的預算報告在哪裡可以拿到？)
A: It's still being worked on. (還在製作中。)

100
00:12:31,500 --> 00:12:44,000
Q: I'll send the application form right away. (我會立刻把申請表寄過去。)
A: Thanks. That'd be great. (謝謝，這樣太好了。（○ 正解）)

101
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:53,500
Q: Should I buy my train ticket now or wait until tomorrow? (我現在該買火車票，還是等到明天？)
A: Tomorrow would be best. (明天買會是最好的。)

102
00:12:53,500 --> 00:12:58,200
Q: 030. Keyword: ask (030 關鍵動詞 ask 朗讀)
A: 回答中出現 ask，正解率約 85%！ (表示轉請他人協助或向主管確認。)

103
00:12:58,200 --> 00:13:06,000
Q: This steamed rice isn't as hot as I'd like. (這蒸飯沒有我想要的那麼熱。)
A: Ask the waitress to heat it up. (請服務生再加熱一下吧。)

104
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:13,000
Q: When will the price of these sweaters be discounted? (這些毛衣什麼時候會打折？)
A: Let me ask my manager. (我去問一下經理。)

105
00:13:13,000 --> 00:13:18,000
Q: 031. Keyword: yet (031 時間副詞 yet 朗讀)
A: 回答中出現 yet，正解率約 80%！ (常用於「還沒完成／還沒看過」的間接回答。)

106
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:25,200
Q: Is the new issue of TOEIC King available yet? (有新一期的《TOEIC KING》可以買了嗎？)
A: No, it's not out yet. (還沒出版喔。)

107
00:13:25,200 --> 00:13:32,500
Q: Why is the store so crowded? (這間店怎麼這麼多人？)
A: You haven't seen today's event schedule, yet. (你還沒看過今天的活動行程表吧。)

108
00:13:32,500 --> 00:13:40,500
Q: 032. Keywords: Let's / Let (032 提議句型 Let's / Let 朗讀)
A: 聽到 let's 或 let，正解機率約 75%！ (包含提出一起行動或等某人再進行。)

109
00:13:40,500 --> 00:13:47,500
Q: Can I start the meeting now? (現在可以開始會議了嗎？)
A: No, let's wait until David comes. (不，我們等 David 來了再開始吧。)

110
00:13:47,500 --> 00:13:54,500
Q: We need to hire another doctor for our clinic. (我們診所需要再雇一位醫生。)
A: Let's start looking soon. (那我們儘快開始找吧。)

111
00:13:54,500 --> 00:14:02,200
Q: Who was working at the loading dock this morning? (今天早上是誰在卸貨碼頭工作？)
A: Jay and Sue. (是 Jay 和 Sue。)

112
00:14:02,200 --> 00:14:09,500
Q: Do you have the itinerary for our business trip? (你有我們出差的行程表嗎？)
A: Nomo is arranging our travel. (Nomo 正在安排我們的行程。)

113
00:14:09,500 --> 00:14:17,500
Q: Who's responsible for reimbursing us for the dinner expenses? (誰負責報銷我們的晚餐費用？)
A: That's Darren's job. (那是 Darren 的工作。)

114
00:14:17,500 --> 00:14:25,200
Q: Where can I get my security badge? (我要去哪裡領取我的安全識別證？)
A: The manager has them. (經理那邊有。)

115
00:14:25,200 --> 00:14:33,200
Q: Have you read the reviews for the movie King Kong? (你看過電影《金剛》的影評了嗎？)
A: OK, we can go see something else. (得了吧，我們還是去看另一部吧。)

116
00:14:33,200 --> 00:14:40,500
Q: Where should we take the guests for dinner tomorrow? (我們明天要帶客人去哪裡吃晚餐呢？)
A: It will be a huge group. (會有一大群人喔。)

117
00:14:40,500 --> 00:14:48,670
Q: Which software should I use to create a new spreadsheet? (要建立新的試算表，我該使用哪一套軟體？)
A: You're the computer expert. (你就是電腦專家啊！)
